    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is28">
        <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e98">Caput 28</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_1@1-3">Vae coronae superbiae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Huc usque ad consummationem mundi</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nec poenitentiae fructum salutis habuit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_1@16-17">Vallis pinguissimae.</quote>
            Gethsemani fertilitate frugum, per eam erat eis ascensus in civitatem, et ibi figebant aliqui, ludi causa, tentoria dum in civitate morabantur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e128">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e130">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e132">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1271B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e136" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_5@1-3">In die illa.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e139"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e140" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e143"><seg type="qs">Secundum prophetiam, cum Dominus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Scribae enim et Pharisaei vino et sicera inebriati sunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e152">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e154">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e156">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e158" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_6@8-9">Fortitudo revertentibus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e161"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e162" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e165">Non leguntur bella Ezechiae, sed Dominus pro eo bellum gessit, interfectis centum et octoginta quinque millibus Assyriorum, quorum Judaei spolia collegerunt: et ad portas Jerusalem cum gaudio reversi sunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e169">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e171">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e173">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e175" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_8@1-2">Omnes enim.</quote>
            Dum Scripturarum non digerunt cibos, nec corpori faciunt vitales, sed immaturos et fetentes egerunt, ut in eis Dominus nullum inveniat locum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e183">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_9@9-12">Ablactatos a lacte, avulsos.</quote>
            Alios non, quia portare non possunt. Hi enim sunt qui jam solido cibo uti possunt; aliis dicit Apostolus: <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e190" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor3_2@1-6">Lac <pb ed="#P" n="1271C"/> dedi vobis potum, non escam</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e197">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e199">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e201">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e203" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_10@1-13">Quia manda, remanda, manda, remanda; exspecta, reexspecta, exspecta, reexspecta, modicum ibi, modicum ibi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e206"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e207" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e210">Quasi dicat. Vos non potestis doceri, quia irridentes prophetas (per quos praedicit Dominus vobis mala superventura, ut poenitentiam agatis et liberemini); opponitis, <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e212" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_10@2-3">manda, remanda;</quote> quasi dicat: O Propheta, praecipe quod vis, minare quae vis; haec tamen non eveniunt quae minaris.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e218">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e220">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e222">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e224" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_11@1-3">In loquela enim.</quote>
            Quasi dicat: Malo vestro haec dicitis, quia non praenuntiabit vobis Dominus amodo mala, sed statim inferet. Et hoc est: <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e227" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_11@1-11">In loquela enim labii et lingua altera loquentur ad populum istum,</quote> etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e232">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e234">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e236">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1271D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e240" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_16">Lapidem. Lapidem quem aedificantes reprobaverunt, hic factus est in caput anguli.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e247">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e249">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e251">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e253" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_19@16-20">Sola vexatio intellectum dabit auditui.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e258">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e260">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e262">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e264" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_21@1-2">Sicut enim.</quote>
            Philisthaeos congregatos superveniens David auxilio Domini, divisit vivos a mortuis et perversa loca dispersit; unde locus ille Baalphrasim nomen accepit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e268">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_21@20-21">Alienum opus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e273"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e274" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e277">Opus proprium Dei est misereri, parcere, condonare. Non suum, sed alienum est, irasci, punire.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e280">
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e282" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/is28_21@20-21"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e284"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e285" ref="#GregoryGreat">GREG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e288">In mundum veniet, ut faciat opus suum, scilicet ut redimat genus humanum; sed ab ipso est alienum opus ejus; non convenit enim Deitati conspui, flagellari, crucifigi.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e293">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e295">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e297">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e299" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_24@1-2">Nunquid tota.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is28-Rd1e302"><name xml:id="gom-is28-Nd1e303" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e306">Pius et misericors <pb ed="#P" n="1272A"/> Deus genus humanum, ut fructum boni operis afferat, arat ut agricola vomere praedicationis, proscindit verbere tribulationis, nunc peste, nunc captivitate corrigit; et hoc est: <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e310" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_24@1-3">Nunquid tota die,</quote> etc.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e316">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e318">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e320">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e322" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_25@7-9">Gith et cyminum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e325"><seg type="qs">Gith et cyminum quae in virga excutiuntur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">clavem scientiae habentes.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is28-Dd1e334">
          <head xml:id="gom-is28-Hd1e336">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is28-d1e338">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is28-Qd1e340" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is28_29@1-7">Et hoc a Domino Deo exivit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
